{"id":"31ab7cd9147d1d88","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-meas-complete-measure.md","title":"ZFC Meas Complete Measure","display":"df-zfc-meas-complete-measure — ZFC Meas Complete Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-meas-complete-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-meas-complete-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-meas-complete-measure — ZFC Meas Complete Measure","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-meas-complete-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-meas-complete-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-meas-complete-measure — ZFC Meas Complete Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure\">../batch13/58-df-measure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu\\in V\\)</span> (measure-space carrier, sigma algebra, and measure candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure\">../batch13/58-df-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasCompleteMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasCompleteMeasure}_S\\)</span> (complete-measure predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}meas\\text{-}complete\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasCompleteMeasure}_S(\\mu,\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\forall N\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(\\mu(N)=0\\to\n\\forall A\\subseteq N\\;(A\\in\\mathcal A)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}meas\\text{-}complete\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasCompleteMeasure}_S(\\mu,\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\forall N\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(\\mu(N)=0\\to\n\\forall A\\subseteq N\\;(A\\in\\mathcal A)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S$ (measure predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-measure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasCompleteMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}meas\\text{-}complete\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasCompleteMeasure}_S(\\mu,\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\forall N\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(\\mu(N)=0\\to\n\\forall A\\subseteq N\\;(A\\in\\mathcal A)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":936,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2527","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-meas-complete-measure.md|58-df-zfc-meas-complete-measure]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca832ed6bc22f728"]}